                    Office Files, Box 41, Kissinger Trip Files, HAK Trip—Mideast, Islamabad, Peking,
                    Tokyo, Seoul, HAKTO 1–60, Nov. 5–16, 1973. Top Secret; Sensitive; Eyes Only;
                    Immediate.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d339-f2" n="2" xml:id="d339-f2-content">
                <p>November 14.</p>
            </note>
